  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 54*16*3*6*2*9\n\nOption 1) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 54 + 16 × 3 –** **__**6 ÷ 2**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 54 + __**16 × 3**__ – 3 = 9\n\n⇒ __**54 + 48**__ – 3 = 9\n\n⇒ __**102 – 3**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 99 = 9\n\nOption 2) ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**54 ÷ 16**__ – 3 × 6 + 2 = 9\n\n⇒ 3.375 – __**3 × 6**__ + 2 = 9\n\n⇒ **__3.375__** – 18 __**+ 2**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**5.375 – 18**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 12.625 = 9\n\n**Option 3) –, ×, +, ÷, =**\n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 54 - 16 × 3 + __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 54 - __**16 × 3**__ + 3 = 9\n\n⇒ __**54**__ - 48 __**+ 3**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**57 - 48**__ = 9\n\n**⇒ 9 = 9**\n\nOption 4) +, –, ×, ÷, = \n\nSigns that can sequentially replace the * signs:\n\n⇒ 54 + 16 – 3 × __**6 ÷ 2**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 54 + 16 – __**3 × 3**__ = 9\n\n⇒ __**54 + 16**__ – 9 = 9\n\n⇒ __**70 – 9**__ = 9\n\n⇒ 61 = 9\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**–, ×, +, ÷, =****\"**.",
